# Compiled Object files, Static and Dynamic libs (Shared Objects)
*.o
*.a
*.so

# Folders
_obj
_test

# Architecture specific extensions/prefixes
*.[568vq]
[568vq].out

*.cgo1.go
*.cgo2.c
_cgo_defun.c
_cgo_gotypes.go
_cgo_export.*

_testmain.go

*.exe
*.test
*.prof

# Config test fixtures use a .yml.test suffix and must be tracked even though
# the *.test rule above (for compiled Go test binaries) would otherwise ignore
# them. Without this negation a plain `git add` silently drops them and the
# cmd/mutago config tests fail on a fresh checkout.
!testdata/configs/*.yml.test

# go-mutesting build output and run artifacts
/go-mutesting
report.json
report.html
go-mutesting-report.html
go-mutesting-summary.json
go-mutesting-agentic.json
*.go.new

# Claude Code local scheduler artifacts
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
